03578186],"scale":[1,0.9999999403953552,1.0000001192092896],"translation":[-9.484210750088096e-09,0.40733101963996887,-2.0954757928848267e-09]},{"children":[48],"name":"calf_r","rotation":[0.058844517916440964,-0.2321772277355194,0.008530084043741226,0.9708544611930847],"scale":[0.9999998807907104,0.9999997615814209,0.9999999403953552],"translation":[-5.587935447692871e-09,0.39470696449279785,7.450580596923828e-09]},{"children":[49],"name":"thigh_r","rotation":[-0.958074688911438,0.09174000471830368,-0.2139034867286682,0.16709880530834198],"scale":[0.9999998211860657,0.9999999403953552,0.9999985098838806],"translation":[-0.10147152096033096,-0.003829043358564377,-0.010990308597683907]},{"children":[42,46,50],"name":"pelvis","rotation":[0.5305899977684021,-1.5553862193127784e-16,-3.88809262563683e-10,0.8476285934448242],"translation":[0,-0.013216575607657433,0.8744488954544067]},{"children":[51],"name":"Root","rotation":[-0.7071067690849304,0,0,0.7071067690849304],"translation":[0,-0.0005625183694064617,6.100162863731384e-08]},{"mesh":0,"name":"Body","skin":0},{"mesh":1,"name":"Eyebrows","skin":0},{"mesh":2,"name":"Eyelashes","skin":0},{"mesh":3,"name":"Eyes","skin":0},{"mesh":4,"name":"Teeth","skin":0},{"mesh":5,"name":"Tongue","skin":0},{"children":[53,54,55,56,57,58,52,60,61,62,63,64],"name":"Lia Banks","extras":{"persona":{"residentId":"AH-R0076","personId":"AH-R0076","name":"Lia Banks","age":32,"occupation":"Beach wheelchair attendant","home":"the western residential streets","episode":"A tide at noon","biography":"stories/residents/01/08-a-tide-at-noon.md#ah-r0076","life":"Lia learned to read sand density pushing her father's chair. A photograph of an accessible beach usually shows the clean path. She wants people to photograph what happens when the path ends. Sunday often includes a stop at Lighthouse Cove, where Lia takes a few minutes by the low rocks, where conversation sounds different as the tide turns.","voice":"The judging route crossed a soft patch I knew wouldn't hold a wheel. I borrowed three boards from the marina and made the judges take the long route with everyone else.","appearance":"On an ordinary day, look for a brown corduroy jacket and a square of clean cloth for polishing smudges. Lia has a crooked front tooth visible when laughing, with black hair twisted into a small knot. Lia folds a paper napkin into quarters without noticing during a conversation.","personality":"Lia treats keeping somebody waiting as a serious discourtesy. This can turn a helpful person into an impatient one when everybody else needs a slower conversation.","agenda":"To keep the wheelchair route open through the entire judging session.","family":"Clyde Darzi is Lia’s cousin raised in the same household. Lia picks the meeting place. Clyde sets the time to leave. It lets them stay close without turning a family visit into the loss of an entire day. They have both had stretches when that distinction mattered. Asked about *The pawned trumpet*, Clyde says, “I repair brass at night. I can give the player a different instrument but I can't transfer those teeth marks.”","connections":"Paz Harrow (beach colleague). They move the judging line together and discover there are two different meanings of a reachable castle.","familyIds":["AH-R0195"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0071"],"reactions":[{"situation":"The judges ask the fastest builder to speak for everyone","response":"Lia asks each child how they would enter their own castle.","asWritten":"The judges ask the fastest builder to speak for everyone. Lia asks each child how they would enter their own castle."},{"situation":"A coworker arrives late after a night at the hospital","response":"Lia asks them privately what can be shared about the delay and respects the answer.","asWritten":"A coworker arrives late after a night at the hospital. Lia asks them privately what can be shared about the delay and respects the answer."},{"situation":"If a frightened person needs longer","response":"Lia changes the plan openly and takes responsibility for the delay.","asWritten":"If a frightened person needs longer, Lia changes the plan openly and takes responsibility for the delay."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_ponytail01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_jacket","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","weight_min","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_decr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_min__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__weight_min"]},"weights":[0.3505,0.6594,0.2005,0.2885,0.3737,0.5177,0.0441,0.2679,0.386,0.2813,0.2764,0.3266,0.2491,0.3471,0.1864,0.1609,0.3264,0,0,0.13221,0.07028,0.23112],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","weight_min","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_d